# PAM integration for focald-secrets — lines to add to Focaldesk's human login
# stack (/etc/pam.d/focaldmd), mirroring pam_gnome_keyring:
#
#   auth      optional  pam_focald_secrets.so
#   session   optional  pam_focald_secrets.so
#   password  optional  pam_focald_secrets.so
#
# Ordering: the auth line goes AFTER pam_unix.so (needs a verified authtok);
# the session line goes AFTER pam_systemd.so (needs XDG_RUNTIME_DIR).
# First login transparently creates the wrapped key; password changes rewrap.
# Install: cp target/release/libpam_focald_secrets.so \
#             /usr/lib64/security/pam_focald_secrets.so     (Fedora)
#          # Debian/Ubuntu path: /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/security/
